    # "The small slime creature inside slithered around in its container."
    "Das kleine Schleimwesen im Inneren schlängelte sich in seinem Behälter umher."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheRavenousJelly/scr.rpy:4
translate de qst_ravenJelly_inspectSlime_2f672038:

    # "It seemed to look towards me when I peered inside, so I know I have its attention."
